    m_Localized: Press S or click the button to continue
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 32740484132872195
    m_Localized: Click the mutant to continue
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 32740484132872207
    m_Localized: Press R or click the button to continue
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 32740484132872219
    m_Localized: Click the button to continue
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 32740484132872202
    m_Localized: Click a character to continue
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 32740484132872204
    m_Localized: Press D or click the button to continue
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 32740484128677891
    m_Localized: "A-a mutant! W-what should we do\u2026?!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 32740484132872192
    m_Localized: What's there to think about? We just charge in, right?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 32740484132872193
    m_Localized: Rushing in blindly is dangerous. We need to learn about our opponent
      first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 32740484132872199
    m_Localized: "I-I think I can help too\u2026!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 32740484132872200
    m_Localized: "I'll use a Compound\u2026 to make your attacks stronger!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 32740484132872208
    m_Localized: I'll circle behind the mutant and limit its movements.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 32740484132872209
    m_Localized: Then I'll keep the pressure on from the front!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 32740484132872210
    m_Localized: Just be careful of its counterattacks from the front.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 32740484132872211
    m_Localized: Tch, so the front's no good. Then I'll hit it from the side!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 32740484132872194
    m_Localized: Click a mutant to inspect its information.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 32740484132872196
    m_Localized: You can see the mutant's planned actions in its Action List.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 32740484132872197
    m_Localized: You can see the mutant's special effects, buffs, and debuffs in
      its Status List.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 32740484132872198
    m_Localized: You can click a mutant at any time during battle to inspect its
      information.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 32740484132872201
    m_Localized: You can also click a character directly to select them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 32740484132872203
    m_Localized: Compounds are used immediately without queuing an action.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 32740484132872205
    m_Localized: Amplification increases attack damage by its effect value.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 32740484132872206
    m_Localized: Use Karma to activate powerful Memories. Grit increases damage dealt
      by 30%.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 32740484132872212
    m_Localized: You can queue actions for multiple characters and execute them together
      in a single turn.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 32740484132872213
    m_Localized: Use movement to evade enemy attacks or secure a favorable position.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 32740484132872214
    m_Localized: Anticipating a mutant's movement and positioning yourself accordingly
      can influence where it moves next turn.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 32740484132872215
    m_Localized: Changing direction occupies 1 space and turns the character without
      moving.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 32740484132872217
    m_Localized: Attacking a mutant from behind can force it to turn around.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 32740484132872218
    m_Localized: Combining your characters' actions opens up a variety of tactics.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 32740484132872220
    m_Localized: Knowing which way a mutant counterattacks lets you dodge its counterattack
      by moving.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 32740484132872221
    m_Localized: It's best to choose your movement destination with the next turn
      in mind.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 32740484132872222
    m_Localized: Combining movement and attacks lets you strike from an advantageous
      position.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 32740484132872223
    m_Localized: Coordinating multiple characters' actions makes combat even more
      effective.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 32740484132872224
    m_Localized: Use the tactics you've learned to defeat the mutant.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 32716823346028544
    m_Localized: Move 2 tiles away from the nearest character.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 32716823371194368
    m_Localized: Deal {ValueRate1} {E_Strike} to the area.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 32716823371194369
    m_Localized: Deal {ValueRate1} {E_Strike} to the area.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 32716823371194370
    m_Localized: Move 2 tiles away from the nearest character.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 32716823371194371
    m_Localized: Charge into the target, deal {ValueRate1} {E_Strike}, and apply
      {E_Knockback} for {ValueRate2} tiles.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 32716823371194372
    m_Localized: Deal {ValueRate1} {E_Strike} to the area.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 32716823371194373
    m_Localized: Deal {ValueRate1} {E_Pierce} to the area ahead.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 32716823371194374
    m_Localized: Deal {ValueRate1} {E_Strike} at the farthest target's location.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 32716823371194375
    m_Localized: Move 1 or 2 tiles away from the nearest character.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 32716823371194376
    m_Localized: Deal {ValueRate1} {E_Strike} to the area.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
